"""
Module 4 - Streamlit frontend (education-themed, animated, authenticated).

Calls the FastAPI backend (Modules 3-4) over HTTP - the backend must be
running separately (uvicorn) for this to work. Every session is tagged to
the logged-in user and saved to SQLite, so history persists and stays
private per student.
"""
